  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Omelet Station.png|left|200px|Omelet Station]]\n\n{{Infobox\n|level = 77\n|price = 600,000\n|time = 3 d 8 h\n|xp = 41\n|slots = 2 \n|dia = 82\n|title = [[Production Buildings|Machine]]\n|size = 2 x 2\n}}\n\nThe '''Omelet Station''' is a [[Production Buildings|production building]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 77. It was added in Summer 2023 update.\n\nIt is used to make the [[Colourful Omelet|colourful omelet]], [[Spring Omelet|spring omelet]], [[Cheese Omelet|cheese omelet,]] [[Rice Omelet|rice omelet]] and [[Potato Omelet|potato omelet]].{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Building'''===\nIt costs 600,000 {{Infoicon|coin}} and takes 3 days 8 hours (or 82 {{Infoicon|dia}}) to build the Omelet Station. It gives players 41 {{Infoicon|xp}} when completed.\n----\n==='''Products'''===\n{{Building Products\n|Colourful Omelet|77|1h|136\n|Spring Omelet|77|40m|230\n|Cheese Omelet|79|1:30|464\n|Rice Omelet|83|2h|572\n|Potato Omelet|87|1:15|270\n}}\n----\n==='''Upgrading'''===\n{{Main|Production Buildings}} \nOmelet station originally has two slots available. Unlocking the third slot costs 6 [[diamond]]s. Players can unlock 7 new slots in total, each new one costing 3 more {{Infoicon|dia}} than the previous one. Alternatively, they can spend a total of 105 {{Infoicon|dia}} to completely upgrade their machine.\n----\n==='''Mastering'''===\nA total of 2,180 hours of production is required to [[Masteries|master]] the omelet station:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 1em 0; border-collapse: collapse;\"\n|-\n| rowspan=\"3\" |[[File:Omelet Station Mastered.png|150px|Mastered Omelet Station]]\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''★<br />140 hrs'''\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''★★<br />410 hrs'''\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''★★★<br />1,630 hrs'''\n|-\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\" |[[File:TruckM10Coins.png|100px]]\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\" |[[File:TruckM5XP.png|100px|]]\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\" |[[File:Omelet Station Mastery.png|100px]]\n|-\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''<span title=\"10% more coins for truck orders\">+10% {{Infoicon|coin}}</span>'''\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''<span title=\"5% more experience points for truck orders\">+5% {{Infoicon|xp}}</span>'''\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''15% faster'''\n|}\n----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\nThe products here aren't very expensive, so it shouldn't be too hard to master. Just remember to keep plenty of eggs.\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Omelettstand\n|es = Puesto de tortillas\n|fr = Stand à Omelettes\n|it = Stand delle omelette\n|no = Omelettstasjon\n|ru = Омлетница\n}}\n[[pt-br:Carrinho de omelete]]\n\n[[Category:Production Buildings]]",
